'''Trick of the Wind''' (風のイタズラ, ''Kaze no Itazura'', '''Trick of the Wind''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (Sm): Knockback distance increases by 10%.

